00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,893
Got a little one who loves monster trucks? Meet Rocco, the little monster truck!

2
00:00:05,793 --> 00:00:08,793
Rocco tries the big ramp. His wheels wobble!

3
00:00:09,693 --> 00:00:11,995
Splat! Rocco lands in the mud.

4
00:00:12,895 --> 00:00:14,677
But his friends say, you can do it!

5
00:00:15,577 --> 00:00:17,522
And Rocco flies high up in the sky!

